{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>今日下午時分，有災民表示經通訊群組得知，今日可在警方安排下進入封鎖區內悼念、燒衣。街坊何小姐表示，自己傍晚六時才知悉有關訊息，隨即回到停車場前等候警民關係組安排。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-26-at-22.29.28-768x1024.jpeg\" width=\"768\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>事隔半年再進入曾經的家園範圍，何小姐認為，如能更早安排會更好，甚至可以截止時間、可逗留時間均一概不知，只能靠街坊口耳相傳，「變咗𠵱家好多街坊都係唔知，我都係突然之間知嘅時候，要嗱嗱聲過嚟。」入夜後，進入封鎖區內悼念的居民除了何小姐，亦包括葉家駒。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-26-at-22.33.17-1-1024x682.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>政府發言人晚上十時回覆查詢指，居民家屬須經核實身份後，方可進入相關範圍進行祭祀。發言人又指，理解居民及家屬災後希望到場悼念心情，又指去年火災後，有不少居民家屬曾在宏福苑範圍內路祭；為顧及其祭祀需要，「警方會在確保現場安全及秩序的前提下，盡力為居民家屬在現場悼念提供協助。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-26-at-22.36.12-768x1024.jpeg\" width=\"768\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-26-at-22.33.18-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:43:59.836629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":5,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:00:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T19:37:32.430663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:14.988775+00:00","content_hash":"ef16f002b7e4dce94b62d318a3f19982c4f21a7ca36128fa2349953d6c589fc9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}